{"parentUuid":"64d56cc6-c370-4f97-b02a-259fdcaf0ecd","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013msUfyFU4XTdQh7oREoasW","type":"tool_result","content":"    60→            black_box(result);\n    61→        });\n    62→    });\n    63→\n    64→    group.finish();\n    65→}\n    66→\n    67→fn bench_graph_execute(c: &mut Criterion) {\n    68→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"graph_execute\");\n    69→\n    70→    let router = QueryRouter::new();\n    71→\n    72→    // Create nodes\n    73→    for i in 0..100 {\n    74→        router\n    75→            .execute_parsed(&format!(\n    76→                \"NODE CREATE person {{id: {}, name: 'person{}'}}\",\n    77→                i, i\n    78→            ))\n    79→            .unwrap();\n    80→    }\n    81→\n    82→    // Create edges\n    83→    for i in 0..99 {\n    84→        router\n    85→            .execute_parsed(&format!(\"EDGE CREATE {} -> {} : friend\", i + 1, i + 2))\n    86→            .unwrap();\n    87→    }\n    88→\n    89→    group.bench_function(\"node_create\", |b| {\n    90→        let mut i = 1000;\n    91→        b.iter(|| {\n    92→            let query = format!(\"NODE CREATE person {{id: {}, name: 'person{}'}}\", i, i);\n    93→            let result = router.execute_parsed(black_box(&query)).unwrap();\n    94→            i += 1;\n    95→            black_box(result);\n    96→        });\n    97→    });\n    98→\n    99→    group.bench_function(\"edge_create\", |b| {\n   100→        let mut i = 1000;\n   101→        b.iter(|| {\n   102→            let query = format!(\"EDGE CREATE {} -> {} : knows\", i, i + 1);\n   103→            let result = router.execute_parsed(black_box(&query)).unwrap();\n   104→            i += 1;\n   105→            black_box(result);\n   106→        });\n   107→    });\n   108→\n   109→    group.bench_function(\"neighbors\", |b| {\n   110→        b.iter(|| {\n   111→            let result = router\n   112→                .execute_parsed(black_box(\"NEIGHBORS 50 OUTGOING\"))\n   113→                .unwrap();\n   114→            black_box(result);\n   115→        });\n   116→    });\n   117→\n   118→    group.bench_function(\"path\", |b| {\n   119→        b.iter(|| {\n   120→            let result = router.execute_parsed(black_box(\"PATH 1 -> 10\")).unwrap();\n   121→            black_box(result);\n   122→        });\n   123→    });\n   124→\n   125→    group.bench_function(\"find_node\", |b| {\n   126→        b.iter(|| {\n   127→            let result = router\n   128→                .execute_parsed(black_box(\"FIND NODE WHERE id > 0\"))\n   129→                .unwrap();\n   130→            black_box(result);\n   131→        });\n   132→    });\n   133→\n   134→    group.finish();\n   135→}\n   136→\n   137→fn bench_vector_execute(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   138→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"vector_execute\");\n   139→\n   140→    let router = QueryRouter::new();\n   141→\n   142→    // Store embeddings\n   143→    for i in 0..100 {\n   144→        let vector: Vec<f64> = (0..128).map(|j| (i * 128 + j) as f64 / 10000.0).collect();\n   145→        let vector_str = vector\n   146→            .iter()\n   147→            .map(|v| format!(\"{:.4}\", v))\n   148→            .collect::<Vec<_>>()\n   149→            .join(\", \");"}]},"uuid":"cf267721-65dd-4bc6-8589-d6dd882efd4c","timestamp":"2026-03-12T00:18:17.671Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/lukin/Neumann/query_router/benches/query_router_bench.rs","content":"            black_box(result);\n        });\n    });\n\n    group.finish();\n}\n\nfn bench_graph_execute(c: &mut Criterion) {\n    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"graph_execute\");\n\n    let router = QueryRouter::new();\n\n    // Create nodes\n    for i in 0..100 {\n        router\n            .execute_parsed(&format!(\n                \"NODE CREATE person {{id: {}, name: 'person{}'}}\",\n                i, i\n            ))\n            .unwrap();\n    }\n\n    // Create edges\n    for i in 0..99 {\n        router\n            .execute_parsed(&format!(\"EDGE CREATE {} -> {} : friend\", i + 1, i + 2))\n            .unwrap();\n    }\n\n    group.bench_function(\"node_create\", |b| {\n        let mut i = 1000;\n        b.iter(|| {\n            let query = format!(\"NODE CREATE person {{id: {}, name: 'person{}'}}\", i, i);\n            let result = router.execute_parsed(black_box(&query)).unwrap();\n            i += 1;\n            black_box(result);\n        });\n    });\n\n    group.bench_function(\"edge_create\", |b| {\n        let mut i = 1000;\n        b.iter(|| {\n            let query = format!(\"EDGE CREATE {} -> {} : knows\", i, i + 1);\n            let result = router.execute_parsed(black_box(&query)).unwrap();\n            i += 1;\n            black_box(result);\n        });\n    });\n\n    group.bench_function(\"neighbors\", |b| {\n        b.iter(|| {\n            let result = router\n                .execute_parsed(black_box(\"NEIGHBORS 50 OUTGOING\"))\n                .unwrap();\n            black_box(result);\n        });\n    });\n\n    group.bench_function(\"path\", |b| {\n        b.iter(|| {\n            let result = router.execute_parsed(black_box(\"PATH 1 -> 10\")).unwrap();\n            black_box(result);\n        });\n    });\n\n    group.bench_function(\"find_node\", |b| {\n        b.iter(|| {\n            let result = router\n                .execute_parsed(black_box(\"FIND NODE WHERE id > 0\"))\n                .unwrap();\n            black_box(result);\n        });\n    });\n\n    group.finish();\n}\n\nfn bench_vector_execute(c: &mut Criterion) {\n    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"vector_execute\");\n\n    let router = QueryRouter::new();\n\n    // Store embeddings\n    for i in 0..100 {\n        let vector: Vec<f64> = (0..128).map(|j| (i * 128 + j) as f64 / 10000.0).collect();\n        let vector_str = vector\n            .iter()\n            .map(|v| format!(\"{:.4}\", v))\n            .collect::<Vec<_>>()\n            .join(\", \");","numLines":90,"startLine":60,"totalLines":495}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"64d56cc6-c370-4f97-b02a-259fdcaf0ecd"}
