{"parentUuid":"778ccb81-cbdc-4c1a-8424-4e57afd5438b","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","type":"progress","data":{"message":{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Ra46XLs5ma46CBybDe2Kpv","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→// SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT OR Apache-2.0\n     2→#![allow(missing_docs)]\n     3→\n     4→use std::collections::HashMap;\n     5→\n     6→use criterion::{black_box, criterion_group, criterion_main, BenchmarkId, Criterion, Throughput};\n     7→use relational_engine::{\n     8→    Column, ColumnType, ColumnarScanOptions, Condition, RelationalEngine, Schema, Value,\n     9→};\n    10→\n    11→fn create_users_schema() -> Schema {\n    12→    Schema::new(vec![\n    13→        Column::new(\"name\", ColumnType::String),\n    14→        Column::new(\"age\", ColumnType::Int),\n    15→        Column::new(\"email\", ColumnType::String).nullable(),\n    16→        Column::new(\"score\", ColumnType::Float),\n    17→    ])\n    18→}\n    19→\n    20→fn create_user_values(id: i64) -> HashMap<String, Value> {\n    21→    let mut values = HashMap::new();\n    22→    values.insert(\"name\".to_string(), Value::String(format!(\"User{id}\")));\n    23→    values.insert(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(20 + (id % 50)));\n    24→    values.insert(\n    25→        \"email\".to_string(),\n    26→        Value::String(format!(\"user{id}@example.com\")),\n    27→    );\n    28→    values.insert(\"score\".to_string(), Value::Float(id as f64 * 0.1));\n    29→    values\n    30→}\n    31→\n    32→fn bench_insert(c: &mut Criterion) {\n    33→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"insert\");\n    34→\n    35→    for size in &[100, 1000, 5000] {\n    36→        group.throughput(Throughput::Elements(*size as u64));\n    37→        group.bench_with_input(BenchmarkId::from_parameter(size), size, |b, &size| {\n    38→            b.iter(|| {\n    39→                let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n    40→                engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n    41→\n    42→                for i in 0..size {\n    43→                    engine\n    44→                        .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n    45→                        .unwrap();\n    46→                }\n    47→                black_box(&engine);\n    48→            });\n    49→        });\n    50→    }\n    51→\n    52→    group.finish();\n    53→}\n    54→\n    55→fn bench_batch_insert(c: &mut Criterion) {\n    56→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"batch_insert\");\n    57→\n    58→    for size in &[100, 1000, 5000] {\n    59→        group.throughput(Throughput::Elements(*size as u64));\n    60→        group.bench_with_input(BenchmarkId::from_parameter(size), size, |b, &size| {\n    61→            // Pre-create the rows vector outside the benchmark loop\n    62→            let rows: Vec<_> = (0..size)\n    63→                .map(|i| create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n    64→                .collect();\n    65→\n    66→            b.iter(|| {\n    67→                let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n    68→                engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n    69→                engine.batch_insert(\"users\", rows.clone()).unwrap();\n    70→                black_box(&engine);\n    71→            });\n    72→        });\n    73→    }\n    74→\n    75→    group.finish();\n    76→}\n    77→\n    78→fn bench_select_full_scan(c: &mut Criterion) {\n    79→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"select_full_scan\");\n    80→\n    81→    for size in &[100, 1000, 5000] {\n    82→        let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n    83→        engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n    84→        for i in 0..*size {\n    85→            engine\n    86→                .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n    87→                .unwrap();\n    88→        }\n    89→\n    90→        group.throughput(Throughput::Elements(*size as u64));\n    91→        group.bench_with_input(BenchmarkId::from_parameter(size), size, |b, _| {\n    92→            b.iter(|| {\n    93→                black_box(engine.select(\"users\", Condition::True).unwrap());\n    94→            });\n    95→        });\n    96→    }\n    97→\n    98→    group.finish();\n    99→}\n   100→\n   101→fn bench_select_filtered(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   102→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"select_filtered\");\n   103→\n   104→    // Setup: 5000 rows, filter matches ~10%\n   105→    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   106→    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   107→    for i in 0..5000 {\n   108→        engine\n   109→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   110→            .unwrap();\n   111→    }\n   112→\n   113→    group.bench_function(\"eq_10_percent\", |b| {\n   114→        b.iter(|| {\n   115→            // age = 25 matches ~2% (100 rows out of 5000)\n   116→            black_box(\n   117→                engine\n   118→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Eq(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(25)))\n   119→                    .unwrap(),\n   120→            );\n   121→        });\n   122→    });\n   123→\n   124→    group.bench_function(\"range_20_percent\", |b| {\n   125→        b.iter(|| {\n   126→            // age >= 60 matches 20% (ages 60-69 out of 20-69)\n   127→            black_box(\n   128→                engine\n   129→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Ge(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(60)))\n   130→                    .unwrap(),\n   131→            );\n   132→        });\n   133→    });\n   134→\n   135→    group.bench_function(\"compound_and\", |b| {\n   136→        b.iter(|| {\n   137→            // age >= 30 AND age < 40\n   138→            let condition = Condition::Ge(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(30))\n   139→                .and(Condition::Lt(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(40)));\n   140→            black_box(engine.select(\"users\", condition).unwrap());\n   141→        });\n   142→    });\n   143→\n   144→    group.finish();\n   145→}\n   146→\n   147→fn bench_select_by_id(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   148→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"select_by_id\");\n   149→\n   150→    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   151→    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   152→    for i in 0..5000 {\n   153→        engine\n   154→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   155→            .unwrap();\n   156→    }\n   157→\n   158→    group.bench_function(\"single_row\", |b| {\n   159→        b.iter(|| {\n   160→            black_box(\n   161→                engine\n   162→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Eq(\"_id\".to_string(), Value::Int(2500)))\n   163→                    .unwrap(),\n   164→            );\n   165→        });\n   166→    });\n   167→\n   168→    group.finish();\n   169→}\n   170→\n   171→fn bench_update(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   172→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"update\");\n   173→\n   174→    group.bench_function(\"update_10_percent\", |b| {\n   175→        b.iter_batched(\n   176→            || {\n   177→                let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   178→                engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   179→                for i in 0..1000 {\n   180→                    engine\n   181→                        .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   182→                        .unwrap();\n   183→                }\n   184→                engine\n   185→            },\n   186→            |engine| {\n   187→                let mut updates = HashMap::new();\n   188→                updates.insert(\"score\".to_string(), Value::Float(999.0));\n   189→                black_box(\n   190→                    engine\n   191→                        .update(\n   192→                            \"users\",\n   193→                            Condition::Lt(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(25)),\n   194→                            updates,\n   195→                        )\n   196→                        .unwrap(),\n   197→                );\n   198→            },\n   199→            criterion::BatchSize::SmallInput,\n   200→        );\n   201→    });\n   202→\n   203→    group.finish();\n   204→}\n   205→\n   206→fn bench_delete(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   207→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"delete\");\n   208→\n   209→    group.bench_function(\"delete_10_percent\", |b| {\n   210→        b.iter_batched(\n   211→            || {\n   212→                let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   213→                engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   214→                for i in 0..1000 {\n   215→                    engine\n   216→                        .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   217→                        .unwrap();\n   218→                }\n   219→                engine\n   220→            },\n   221→            |engine| {\n   222→                black_box(\n   223→                    engine\n   224→                        .delete_rows(\"users\", Condition::Lt(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(25)))\n   225→                        .unwrap(),\n   226→                );\n   227→            },\n   228→            criterion::BatchSize::SmallInput,\n   229→        );\n   230→    });\n   231→\n   232→    group.finish();\n   233→}\n   234→\n   235→fn bench_join(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   236→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"join\");\n   237→\n   238→    // Setup users and posts tables\n   239→    fn setup_tables(num_users: i64, posts_per_user: i64) -> RelationalEngine {\n   240→        let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   241→\n   242→        let users_schema = Schema::new(vec![\n   243→            Column::new(\"name\", ColumnType::String),\n   244→            Column::new(\"age\", ColumnType::Int),\n   245→        ]);\n   246→        engine.create_table(\"users\", users_schema).unwrap();\n   247→\n   248→        let posts_schema = Schema::new(vec![\n   249→            Column::new(\"user_id\", ColumnType::Int),\n   250→            Column::new(\"title\", ColumnType::String),\n   251→            Column::new(\"views\", ColumnType::Int),\n   252→        ]);\n   253→        engine.create_table(\"posts\", posts_schema).unwrap();\n   254→\n   255→        for i in 1..=num_users {\n   256→            let mut user_values = HashMap::new();\n   257→            user_values.insert(\"name\".to_string(), Value::String(format!(\"User{i}\")));\n   258→            user_values.insert(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(20 + i));\n   259→            engine.insert(\"users\", user_values).unwrap();\n   260→\n   261→            for j in 0..posts_per_user {\n   262→                let mut post_values = HashMap::new();\n   263→                post_values.insert(\"user_id\".to_string(), Value::Int(i));\n   264→                post_values.insert(\n   265→                    \"title\".to_string(),\n   266→                    Value::String(format!(\"Post {j} by User {i}\")),\n   267→                );\n   268→                post_values.insert(\"views\".to_string(), Value::Int(j * 10));\n   269→                engine.insert(\"posts\", post_values).unwrap();\n   270→            }\n   271→        }\n   272→\n   273→        engine\n   274→    }\n   275→\n   276→    // 50 users x 10 posts = 500 join results\n   277→    let engine_small = setup_tables(50, 10);\n   278→    group.bench_function(\"50x10_500_results\", |b| {\n   279→        b.iter(|| {\n   280→            black_box(\n   281→                engine_small\n   282→                    .join(\"users\", \"posts\", \"_id\", \"user_id\")\n   283→                    .unwrap(),\n   284→            );\n   285→        });\n   286→    });\n   287→\n   288→    // 100 users x 10 posts = 1000 join results\n   289→    let engine_medium = setup_tables(100, 10);\n   290→    group.bench_function(\"100x10_1000_results\", |b| {\n   291→        b.iter(|| {\n   292→            black_box(\n   293→                engine_medium\n   294→                    .join(\"users\", \"posts\", \"_id\", \"user_id\")\n   295→                    .unwrap(),\n   296→            );\n   297→        });\n   298→    });\n   299→\n   300→    // 100 users x 50 posts = 5000 join results\n   301→    let engine_large = setup_tables(100, 50);\n   302→    group.bench_function(\"100x50_5000_results\", |b| {\n   303→        b.iter(|| {\n   304→            black_box(\n   305→                engine_large\n   306→                    .join(\"users\", \"posts\", \"_id\", \"user_id\")\n   307→                    .unwrap(),\n   308→            );\n   309→        });\n   310→    });\n   311→\n   312→    group.finish();\n   313→}\n   314→\n   315→fn bench_row_count(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   316→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"row_count\");\n   317→\n   318→    for size in &[100, 1000, 5000] {\n   319→        let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   320→        engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   321→        for i in 0..*size {\n   322→            engine\n   323→                .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   324→                .unwrap();\n   325→        }\n   326→\n   327→        group.bench_with_input(BenchmarkId::from_parameter(size), size, |b, _| {\n   328→            b.iter(|| {\n   329→                black_box(engine.row_count(\"users\").unwrap());\n   330→            });\n   331→        });\n   332→    }\n   333→\n   334→    group.finish();\n   335→}\n   336→\n   337→fn bench_indexed_select(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   338→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"indexed_select\");\n   339→\n   340→    // Setup: 5000 rows with index on age\n   341→    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   342→    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   343→    for i in 0..5000 {\n   344→        engine\n   345→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   346→            .unwrap();\n   347→    }\n   348→    engine.create_index(\"users\", \"age\").unwrap();\n   349→\n   350→    group.bench_function(\"eq_with_index_2_percent\", |b| {\n   351→        b.iter(|| {\n   352→            // age = 25 matches 2% (100 rows out of 5000)\n   353→            black_box(\n   354→                engine\n   355→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Eq(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(25)))\n   356→                    .unwrap(),\n   357→            );\n   358→        });\n   359→    });\n   360→\n   361→    // Compare without index\n   362→    let engine_no_idx = RelationalEngine::new();\n   363→    engine_no_idx\n   364→        .create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema())\n   365→        .unwrap();\n   366→    for i in 0..5000 {\n   367→        engine_no_idx\n   368→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   369→            .unwrap();\n   370→    }\n   371→\n   372→    group.bench_function(\"eq_without_index_2_percent\", |b| {\n   373→        b.iter(|| {\n   374→            black_box(\n   375→                engine_no_idx\n   376→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Eq(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(25)))\n   377→                    .unwrap(),\n   378→            );\n   379→        });\n   380→    });\n   381→\n   382→    group.finish();\n   383→}\n   384→\n   385→fn bench_indexed_select_by_id(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   386→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"indexed_select_by_id\");\n   387→\n   388→    // Setup: 5000 rows\n   389→    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   390→    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   391→    for i in 0..5000 {\n   392→        engine\n   393→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   394→            .unwrap();\n   395→    }\n   396→    engine.create_index(\"users\", \"_id\").unwrap();\n   397→\n   398→    group.bench_function(\"by_id_with_index\", |b| {\n   399→        b.iter(|| {\n   400→            black_box(\n   401→                engine\n   402→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Eq(\"_id\".to_string(), Value::Int(2500)))\n   403→                    .unwrap(),\n   404→            );\n   405→        });\n   406→    });\n   407→\n   408→    // Compare without index\n   409→    let engine_no_idx = RelationalEngine::new();\n   410→    engine_no_idx\n   411→        .create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema())\n   412→        .unwrap();\n   413→    for i in 0..5000 {\n   414→        engine_no_idx\n   415→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   416→            .unwrap();\n   417→    }\n   418→\n   419→    group.bench_function(\"by_id_without_index\", |b| {\n   420→        b.iter(|| {\n   421→            black_box(\n   422→                engine_no_idx\n   423→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Eq(\"_id\".to_string(), Value::Int(2500)))\n   424→                    .unwrap(),\n   425→            );\n   426→        });\n   427→    });\n   428→\n   429→    group.finish();\n   430→}\n   431→\n   432→fn bench_create_index(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   433→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"create_index\");\n   434→\n   435→    for size in &[100, 1000, 5000] {\n   436→        group.bench_with_input(BenchmarkId::from_parameter(size), size, |b, &size| {\n   437→            b.iter_batched(\n   438→                || {\n   439→                    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   440→                    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   441→                    for i in 0..size {\n   442→                        engine\n   443→                            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   444→                            .unwrap();\n   445→                    }\n   446→                    engine\n   447→                },\n   448→                |engine| {\n   449→                    let _: () = engine.create_index(\"users\", \"age\").unwrap();\n   450→                    black_box(());\n   451→                },\n   452→                criterion::BatchSize::SmallInput,\n   453→            );\n   454→        });\n   455→    }\n   456→\n   457→    group.finish();\n   458→}\n   459→\n   460→fn bench_btree_indexed_range(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   461→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"btree_range_query\");\n   462→\n   463→    // Setup: 5000 rows with B-tree index on age\n   464→    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   465→    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   466→    for i in 0..5000 {\n   467→        engine\n   468→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   469→            .unwrap();\n   470→    }\n   471→    engine.create_btree_index(\"users\", \"age\").unwrap();\n   472→\n   473→    group.bench_function(\"ge_with_btree_20_percent\", |b| {\n   474→        b.iter(|| {\n   475→            // age >= 60 matches 20% (ages 60-69 out of 20-69)\n   476→            black_box(\n   477→                engine\n   478→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Ge(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(60)))\n   479→                    .unwrap(),\n   480→            );\n   481→        });\n   482→    });\n   483→\n   484→    group.bench_function(\"lt_with_btree_10_percent\", |b| {\n   485→        b.iter(|| {\n   486→            // age < 25 matches 10% (ages 20-24 out of 20-69)\n   487→            black_box(\n   488→                engine\n   489→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Lt(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(25)))\n   490→                    .unwrap(),\n   491→            );\n   492→        });\n   493→    });\n   494→\n   495→    // Compare without B-tree index\n   496→    let engine_no_idx = RelationalEngine::new();\n   497→    engine_no_idx\n   498→        .create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema())\n   499→        .unwrap();\n   500→    for i in 0..5000 {\n   501→        engine_no_idx\n   502→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   503→            .unwrap();\n   504→    }\n   505→\n   506→    group.bench_function(\"ge_without_btree_20_percent\", |b| {\n   507→        b.iter(|| {\n   508→            black_box(\n   509→                engine_no_idx\n   510→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Ge(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(60)))\n   511→                    .unwrap(),\n   512→            );\n   513→        });\n   514→    });\n   515→\n   516→    group.bench_function(\"lt_without_btree_10_percent\", |b| {\n   517→        b.iter(|| {\n   518→            black_box(\n   519→                engine_no_idx\n   520→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Lt(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(25)))\n   521→                    .unwrap(),\n   522→            );\n   523→        });\n   524→    });\n   525→\n   526→    group.finish();\n   527→}\n   528→\n   529→fn bench_btree_compound_range(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   530→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"btree_compound_range\");\n   531→\n   532→    // Setup: 5000 rows with B-tree index on age\n   533→    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   534→    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   535→    for i in 0..5000 {\n   536→        engine\n   537→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   538→            .unwrap();\n   539→    }\n   540→    engine.create_btree_index(\"users\", \"age\").unwrap();\n   541→\n   542→    group.bench_function(\"range_and_with_btree\", |b| {\n   543→        b.iter(|| {\n   544→            // age >= 30 AND age < 40 (20% of rows)\n   545→            let condition = Condition::Ge(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(30))\n   546→                .and(Condition::Lt(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(40)));\n   547→            black_box(engine.select(\"users\", condition).unwrap());\n   548→        });\n   549→    });\n   550→\n   551→    // Compare without B-tree index\n   552→    let engine_no_idx = RelationalEngine::new();\n   553→    engine_no_idx\n   554→        .create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema())\n   555→        .unwrap();\n   556→    for i in 0..5000 {\n   557→        engine_no_idx\n   558→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   559→            .unwrap();\n   560→    }\n   561→\n   562→    group.bench_function(\"range_and_without_btree\", |b| {\n   563→        b.iter(|| {\n   564→            let condition = Condition::Ge(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(30))\n   565→                .and(Condition::Lt(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(40)));\n   566→            black_box(engine_no_idx.select(\"users\", condition).unwrap());\n   567→        });\n   568→    });\n   569→\n   570→    group.finish();\n   571→}\n   572→\n   573→fn bench_create_btree_index(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   574→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"create_btree_index\");\n   575→\n   576→    for size in &[100, 1000, 5000] {\n   577→        group.bench_with_input(BenchmarkId::from_parameter(size), size, |b, &size| {\n   578→            b.iter_batched(\n   579→                || {\n   580→                    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   581→                    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   582→                    for i in 0..size {\n   583→                        engine\n   584→                            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   585→                            .unwrap();\n   586→                    }\n   587→                    engine\n   588→                },\n   589→                |engine| {\n   590→                    let _: () = engine.create_btree_index(\"users\", \"age\").unwrap();\n   591→                    black_box(());\n   592→                },\n   593→                criterion::BatchSize::SmallInput,\n   594→            );\n   595→        });\n   596→    }\n   597→\n   598→    group.finish();\n   599→}\n   600→\n   601→fn bench_columnar_vs_row_full_scan(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   602→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"columnar_vs_row_full_scan\");\n   603→\n   604→    for size in &[1000, 5000, 10000] {\n   605→        let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   606→        engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   607→        for i in 0..*size {\n   608→            engine\n   609→                .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   610→                .unwrap();\n   611→        }\n   612→        // Materialize columns for columnar scan\n   613→        engine\n   614→            .materialize_columns(\"users\", &[\"name\", \"age\", \"email\", \"score\"])\n   615→            .unwrap();\n   616→\n   617→        group.throughput(Throughput::Elements(*size as u64));\n   618→\n   619→        group.bench_with_input(BenchmarkId::new(\"row_based\", size), size, |b, _| {\n   620→            b.iter(|| {\n   621→                black_box(engine.select(\"users\", Condition::True).unwrap());\n   622→            });\n   623→        });\n   624→\n   625→        group.bench_with_input(BenchmarkId::new(\"columnar\", size), size, |b, _| {\n   626→            let options = ColumnarScanOptions {\n   627→                projection: None,\n   628→                prefer_columnar: true,\n   629→            };\n   630→            b.iter(|| {\n   631→                black_box(\n   632→                    engine\n   633→                        .select_columnar(\"users\", Condition::True, options.clone())\n   634→                        .unwrap(),\n   635→                );\n   636→            });\n   637→        });\n   638→    }\n   639→\n   640→    group.finish();\n   641→}\n   642→\n   643→fn bench_columnar_vs_row_filtered(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   644→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"columnar_vs_row_filtered\");\n   645→\n   646→    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   647→    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   648→    for i in 0..10000 {\n   649→        engine\n   650→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   651→            .unwrap();\n   652→    }\n   653→    engine.materialize_columns(\"users\", &[\"age\"]).unwrap();\n   654→\n   655→    // age >= 60 matches 20%\n   656→    group.bench_function(\"row_ge_20_percent\", |b| {\n   657→        b.iter(|| {\n   658→            black_box(\n   659→                engine\n   660→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Ge(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(60)))\n   661→                    .unwrap(),\n   662→            );\n   663→        });\n   664→    });\n   665→\n   666→    group.bench_function(\"columnar_ge_20_percent\", |b| {\n   667→        let options = ColumnarScanOptions {\n   668→            projection: None,\n   669→            prefer_columnar: true,\n   670→        };\n   671→        b.iter(|| {\n   672→            black_box(\n   673→                engine\n   674→                    .select_columnar(\n   675→                        \"users\",\n   676→                        Condition::Ge(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(60)),\n   677→                        options.clone(),\n   678→                    )\n   679→                    .unwrap(),\n   680→            );\n   681→        });\n   682→    });\n   683→\n   684→    // age = 25 matches 2%\n   685→    group.bench_function(\"row_eq_2_percent\", |b| {\n   686→        b.iter(|| {\n   687→            black_box(\n   688→                engine\n   689→                    .select(\"users\", Condition::Eq(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(25)))\n   690→                    .unwrap(),\n   691→            );\n   692→        });\n   693→    });\n   694→\n   695→    group.bench_function(\"columnar_eq_2_percent\", |b| {\n   696→        let options = ColumnarScanOptions {\n   697→            projection: None,\n   698→            prefer_columnar: true,\n   699→        };\n   700→        b.iter(|| {\n   701→            black_box(\n   702→                engine\n   703→                    .select_columnar(\n   704→                        \"users\",\n   705→                        Condition::Eq(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(25)),\n   706→                        options.clone(),\n   707→                    )\n   708→                    .unwrap(),\n   709→            );\n   710→        });\n   711→    });\n   712→\n   713→    // Compound: age >= 30 AND age < 40 (20%)\n   714→    group.bench_function(\"row_compound_and\", |b| {\n   715→        b.iter(|| {\n   716→            let condition = Condition::Ge(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(30))\n   717→                .and(Condition::Lt(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(40)));\n   718→            black_box(engine.select(\"users\", condition).unwrap());\n   719→        });\n   720→    });\n   721→\n   722→    group.bench_function(\"columnar_compound_and\", |b| {\n   723→        let options = ColumnarScanOptions {\n   724→            projection: None,\n   725→            prefer_columnar: true,\n   726→        };\n   727→        b.iter(|| {\n   728→            let condition = Condition::Ge(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(30))\n   729→                .and(Condition::Lt(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(40)));\n   730→            black_box(\n   731→                engine\n   732→                    .select_columnar(\"users\", condition, options.clone())\n   733→                    .unwrap(),\n   734→            );\n   735→        });\n   736→    });\n   737→\n   738→    group.finish();\n   739→}\n   740→\n   741→fn bench_columnar_projection(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   742→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"columnar_projection\");\n   743→\n   744→    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   745→    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   746→    for i in 0..10000 {\n   747→        engine\n   748→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   749→            .unwrap();\n   750→    }\n   751→    engine\n   752→        .materialize_columns(\"users\", &[\"name\", \"age\", \"email\", \"score\"])\n   753→        .unwrap();\n   754→\n   755→    // Full row fetch (all columns)\n   756→    group.bench_function(\"all_columns\", |b| {\n   757→        let options = ColumnarScanOptions {\n   758→            projection: None,\n   759→            prefer_columnar: true,\n   760→        };\n   761→        b.iter(|| {\n   762→            black_box(\n   763→                engine\n   764→                    .select_columnar(\"users\", Condition::True, options.clone())\n   765→                    .unwrap(),\n   766→            );\n   767→        });\n   768→    });\n   769→\n   770→    // Single column projection\n   771→    group.bench_function(\"single_column\", |b| {\n   772→        let options = ColumnarScanOptions {\n   773→            projection: Some(vec![\"age\".to_string()]),\n   774→            prefer_columnar: true,\n   775→        };\n   776→        b.iter(|| {\n   777→            black_box(\n   778→                engine\n   779→                    .select_columnar(\"users\", Condition::True, options.clone())\n   780→                    .unwrap(),\n   781→            );\n   782→        });\n   783→    });\n   784→\n   785→    // Two columns\n   786→    group.bench_function(\"two_columns\", |b| {\n   787→        let options = ColumnarScanOptions {\n   788→            projection: Some(vec![\"name\".to_string(), \"age\".to_string()]),\n   789→            prefer_columnar: true,\n   790→        };\n   791→        b.iter(|| {\n   792→            black_box(\n   793→                engine\n   794→                    .select_columnar(\"users\", Condition::True, options.clone())\n   795→                    .unwrap(),\n   796→            );\n   797→        });\n   798→    });\n   799→\n   800→    group.finish();\n   801→}\n   802→\n   803→fn bench_materialize_columns(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   804→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"materialize_columns\");\n   805→\n   806→    for size in &[1000, 5000, 10000] {\n   807→        group.bench_with_input(BenchmarkId::from_parameter(size), size, |b, &size| {\n   808→            b.iter_batched(\n   809→                || {\n   810→                    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   811→                    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   812→                    for i in 0..size {\n   813→                        engine\n   814→                            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   815→                            .unwrap();\n   816→                    }\n   817→                    engine\n   818→                },\n   819→                |engine| {\n   820→                    let _: () = engine\n   821→                        .materialize_columns(\"users\", &[\"name\", \"age\", \"email\", \"score\"])\n   822→                        .unwrap();\n   823→                    black_box(());\n   824→                },\n   825→                criterion::BatchSize::SmallInput,\n   826→            );\n   827→        });\n   828→    }\n   829→\n   830→    group.finish();\n   831→}\n   832→\n   833→fn bench_pure_columnar_vs_row(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   834→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"pure_columnar_vs_row\");\n   835→\n   836→    // Setup with materialized columns\n   837→    let engine_columnar = RelationalEngine::new();\n   838→    engine_columnar\n   839→        .create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema())\n   840→        .unwrap();\n   841→    for i in 0..10000 {\n   842→        engine_columnar\n   843→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   844→            .unwrap();\n   845→    }\n   846→    engine_columnar\n   847→        .materialize_columns(\"users\", &[\"name\", \"age\", \"email\", \"score\"])\n   848→        .unwrap();\n   849→\n   850→    // Setup without materialized columns (row-based only)\n   851→    let engine_row = RelationalEngine::new();\n   852→    engine_row\n   853→        .create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema())\n   854→        .unwrap();\n   855→    for i in 0..10000 {\n   856→        engine_row\n   857→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   858→            .unwrap();\n   859→    }\n   860→\n   861→    // Compare single column projection\n   862→    let proj_single = Some(vec![\"age\".to_string()]);\n   863→\n   864→    group.bench_function(\"row_single_col\", |b| {\n   865→        b.iter(|| {\n   866→            black_box(\n   867→                engine_row\n   868→                    .select_with_projection(\"users\", Condition::True, proj_single.clone())\n   869→                    .unwrap(),\n   870→            );\n   871→        });\n   872→    });\n   873→\n   874→    group.bench_function(\"columnar_single_col\", |b| {\n   875→        let options = ColumnarScanOptions {\n   876→            projection: Some(vec![\"age\".to_string()]),\n   877→            prefer_columnar: true,\n   878→        };\n   879→        b.iter(|| {\n   880→            black_box(\n   881→                engine_columnar\n   882→                    .select_columnar(\"users\", Condition::True, options.clone())\n   883→                    .unwrap(),\n   884→            );\n   885→        });\n   886→    });\n   887→\n   888→    // Compare two columns\n   889→    let proj_two = Some(vec![\"name\".to_string(), \"age\".to_string()]);\n   890→\n   891→    group.bench_function(\"row_two_cols\", |b| {\n   892→        b.iter(|| {\n   893→            black_box(\n   894→                engine_row\n   895→                    .select_with_projection(\"users\", Condition::True, proj_two.clone())\n   896→                    .unwrap(),\n   897→            );\n   898→        });\n   899→    });\n   900→\n   901→    group.bench_function(\"columnar_two_cols\", |b| {\n   902→        let options = ColumnarScanOptions {\n   903→            projection: Some(vec![\"name\".to_string(), \"age\".to_string()]),\n   904→            prefer_columnar: true,\n   905→        };\n   906→        b.iter(|| {\n   907→            black_box(\n   908→                engine_columnar\n   909→                    .select_columnar(\"users\", Condition::True, options.clone())\n   910→                    .unwrap(),\n   911→            );\n   912→        });\n   913→    });\n   914→\n   915→    group.finish();\n   916→}\n   917→\n   918→fn bench_aggregation(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   919→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"aggregation\");\n   920→\n   921→    // Setup: 10,000 rows\n   922→    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   923→    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   924→    for i in 0..10_000 {\n   925→        engine\n   926→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   927→            .unwrap();\n   928→    }\n   929→\n   930→    group.bench_function(\"count_all\", |b| {\n   931→        b.iter(|| {\n   932→            black_box(engine.count(\"users\", Condition::True).unwrap());\n   933→        });\n   934→    });\n   935→\n   936→    group.bench_function(\"count_filtered\", |b| {\n   937→        b.iter(|| {\n   938→            black_box(\n   939→                engine\n   940→                    .count(\"users\", Condition::Ge(\"age\".to_string(), Value::Int(50)))\n   941→                    .unwrap(),\n   942→            );\n   943→        });\n   944→    });\n   945→\n   946→    group.bench_function(\"sum\", |b| {\n   947→        b.iter(|| {\n   948→            black_box(engine.sum(\"users\", \"score\", Condition::True).unwrap());\n   949→        });\n   950→    });\n   951→\n   952→    group.bench_function(\"avg\", |b| {\n   953→        b.iter(|| {\n   954→            black_box(engine.avg(\"users\", \"score\", Condition::True).unwrap());\n   955→        });\n   956→    });\n   957→\n   958→    group.bench_function(\"min\", |b| {\n   959→        b.iter(|| {\n   960→            black_box(engine.min(\"users\", \"age\", Condition::True).unwrap());\n   961→        });\n   962→    });\n   963→\n   964→    group.bench_function(\"max\", |b| {\n   965→        b.iter(|| {\n   966→            black_box(engine.max(\"users\", \"age\", Condition::True).unwrap());\n   967→        });\n   968→    });\n   969→\n   970→    group.finish();\n   971→}\n   972→\n   973→fn bench_group_by(c: &mut Criterion) {\n   974→    use relational_engine::AggregateExpr;\n   975→\n   976→    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"group_by\");\n   977→\n   978→    // Setup: 10,000 rows with 50 age groups (ages 20-69)\n   979→    let engine = RelationalEngine::new();\n   980→    engine.create_table(\"users\", create_users_schema()).unwrap();\n   981→    for i in 0..10_000 {\n   982→        engine\n   983→            .insert(\"users\", create_user_values(i64::from(i)))\n   984→            .unwrap();\n   985→    }\n   986→\n   987→    group.bench_function(\"count_by_age\", |b| {\n   988→        b.iter(|| {\n   989→            black_box(\n   990→                engine\n   991→                    .select_grouped(\n   992→                        \"users\",\n   993→                        Condition::True,\n   994→                        &[\"age\".to_string()],\n   995→                        &[AggregateExpr::CountAll],\n   996→                        None,\n   997→                    )\n   998→                    .unwrap(),\n   999→            );\n  1000→        });\n  1001→    });\n  1002→\n  1003→    group.bench_function(\"sum_score_by_age\", |b| {\n  1004→        b.iter(|| {\n  1005→            black_box(\n  1006→                engine\n  1007→                    .select_grouped(\n  1008→                        \"users\",\n  1009→                        Condition::True,\n  1010→                        &[\"age\".to_string()],\n  1011→                        &[\n  1012→                            AggregateExpr::CountAll,\n  1013→                            AggregateExpr::Sum(\"score\".to_string()),\n  1014→                        ],\n  1015→                        None,\n  1016→                    )\n  1017→                    .unwrap(),\n  1018→            );\n  1019→        });\n  1020→    });\n  1021→\n  1022→    group.bench_function(\"with_having\", |b| {\n  1023→        use relational_engine::{AggregateRef, HavingCondition};\n  1024→        b.iter(|| {\n  1025→            black_box(\n  1026→                engine\n  1027→                    .select_grouped(\n  1028→                        \"users\",\n  1029→                        Condition::True,\n  1030→                        &[\"age\".to_string()],\n  1031→                        &[AggregateExpr::CountAll],\n  1032→                        Some(HavingCondition::Gt(AggregateRef::CountAll, Value::Int(100))),\n  1033→                    )\n  1034→                    .unwrap(),\n  1035→            );\n  1036→        });\n  1037→    });\n  1038→\n  1039→    group.finish();\n  1040→}\n  1041→\n  1042→criterion_group!(\n  1043→    benches,\n  1044→    bench_insert,\n  1045→    bench_batch_insert,\n  1046→    bench_select_full_scan,\n  1047→    bench_select_filtered,\n  1048→    bench_select_by_id,\n  1049→    bench_update,\n  1050→    bench_delete,\n  1051→    bench_join,\n  1052→    bench_row_count,\n  1053→    bench_indexed_select,\n  1054→    bench_indexed_select_by_id,\n  1055→    bench_create_index,\n  1056→    bench_btree_indexed_range,\n  1057→    bench_btree_compound_range,\n  1058→    bench_create_btree_index,\n  1059→    bench_columnar_vs_row_full_scan,\n  1060→    bench_columnar_vs_row_filtered,\n  1061→    bench_columnar_projection,\n  1062→    bench_materialize_columns,\n  1063→    bench_pure_columnar_vs_row,\n  1064→    bench_aggregation,\n  1065→    bench_group_by,\n  1066→);\n  1067→\n  1068→criterion_main!(benches);\n  1069→"}]},"uuid":"4d7648d6-f77e-4866-af5a-16f9538a07cc