{"parentUuid":"c2c9f326-cbad-4dfc-b60c-04a66f9da944","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LcDD5yVcNtDyodJTryvynF","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! Now I have all the information I need. Let me compile a comprehensive report of all benchmark targets and their groups.\n\n## Benchmark Summary Report\n\nHere's a complete overview of all **14 `[[bench]]` targets** across the Neumann workspace with their benchmark groups and configurations:\n\n---\n\n### 1. **tensor_store** (3 targets)\n\n#### tensor_store_bench\n- **Groups**: `put`, `get`, `scan`, `bloom_filter`, `kmeans`, `tiered`, `slab_concurrent`, `dict_scan`\n- **Configurations**: No special settings mentioned\n\n#### hnsw_concurrent_bench\n- **Groups**: `hnsw_concurrent/insert`, `hnsw_concurrent/search`, `hnsw_concurrent/mixed`\n- **Configurations**: No custom settings (uses default criterion)\n\n#### wal_bench\n- **Groups**: `wal_immediate`, `wal_batched`, `wal_recovery`\n- **Configurations**: No custom settings\n\n---\n\n### 2. **relational_engine**\n\n#### relational_engine_bench\n- **Groups**: `insert`, `batch_insert`, `select_full_scan`, `select_filtered`, `select_by_id`, `update`, `delete`, `join`, `row_count`, `indexed_select`, `indexed_select_by_id`, `create_index`, `btree_range_query`, `btree_compound_range`, `create_btree_index`, `columnar_vs_row_full_scan`, `columnar_vs_row_filtered`, `columnar_projection`, `materialize_columns`, `pure_columnar_vs_row`, `aggregation`, `group_by`\n- **Configurations**: No custom settings\n- **Note**: Has bench target with `harness = false`\n\n---\n\n### 3. **tensor_chain**\n\n#### tensor_chain_bench\n- **Groups**: `block_creation`, `transaction_commit`, `batch_transactions`, `consensus_validation`, `codebook_operations`, `delta_vector_ops`, `chain_queries`, `raft_consensus`, `distributed_2pc`, `gossip_operations`, `snapshot_operations`, `membership_management`, `deadlock_detection`\n- **Configurations**: No custom settings\n\n---\n\n### 4. **tensor_compress**\n\n#### tensor_compress_bench\n- **Groups**: (functions benchmarked individually, no explicit groups)\n  - `compress_ids_10k_sequential`\n  - `decompress_ids_10k_sequential`\n  - `rle_encode_100k_values`\n  - `rle_decode_100k_values`\n  - `tt_decompose_256d`, `tt_decompose_1024d`, `tt_decompose_4096d`\n  - `tt_reconstruct_4096d`\n  - `tt_dot_product_4096d`\n  - `tt_cosine_similarity_4096d`\n  - `tt_compression_ratio_4096d`\n- **Configurations**: Uses `peak_alloc` for memory tracking\n- **Note**: Prints peak RAM usage for each benchmark\n\n---\n\n### 5. **neumann_parser**\n\n#### neumann_parser_bench\n- **Groups**: `tokenize`, `parse`, `expression_complexity`, `batch_parse`, `large_queries`\n- **Configurations**: No custom settings\n\n---\n\n### 6. **tensor_blob**\n\n#### blob_bench\n- **Groups**: (individual benchmarks, no explicit groups)\n  - `put_1kb`, `put_1mb`\n  - `get_1mb`\n  - `metadata_lookup`\n  - `chunk_sizes` (with sizes: 256KB, 512KB, 1MB, 2MB)\n  - `deduplication`\n- **Configurations**: Uses async_tokio for async benchmarking\n- **Note**: Async benchmarks with Tokio runtime\n\n---\n\n### 7. **graph_engine**\n\n#### graph_engine_bench\n- **Groups**: `create_nodes`, `create_edges`, `neighbors`, `traverse`, `find_path`, `find_path_branching`, `weighted_shortest_path`\n- **Concurrent Groups** (via separate `criterion_group!`): `concurrent_node_creation`, `concurrent_update_node`, `concurrent_batch_operations`, `striped_lock_contention`, `concurrent_neighbor_lookup`, `concurrent_traversal`, `concurrent_mixed_read_write`, `concurrent_property_index_query`, `concurrent_large_graph`\n- **Configurations**: \n  - `striped_lock_contention`: `sample_size(20)`\n  - `concurrent_neighbor_lookup`: `sample_size(10)`\n  - `concurrent_traversal`: `sample_size(10)`\n  - `concurrent_mixed_read_write`: `sample_size(10)`\n  - `concurrent_property_index_query`: `sample_size(10)`\n  - `concurrent_large_graph`: `sample_size(10)`\n\n---\n\n### 8. **vector_engine**\n\n#### vector_engine_bench\n- **Groups**: `store_embedding`, `search_similar`, `compute_similarity`, (direct benchmarks for `get_embedding`, `delete_embedding`), `hnsw_insert`, `hnsw_search`, `hnsw_vs_brute`, `hnsw_configs`, `metric_comparison`\n- **Configurations**: No custom settings\n\n---\n\n### 9. **tensor_vault**\n\n#### tensor_vault_bench\n- **Groups**: `vault_crypto`, `vault_encrypt`, `vault_access`, `vault_list`\n- **Configurations**: Uses `peak_alloc` for memory tracking\n- **Note**: Prints peak RAM usage for cryptographic operations\n\n---\n\n### 10. **tensor_cache**\n\n#### cache_bench\n- **Groups**: (individual benchmarks, no explicit groups)\n  - `exact_lookup_hit`, `exact_lookup_miss`\n  - `semantic_lookup_hit`\n  - `put` (sizes: 100, 1000, 10000)\n  - `embedding_lookup_hit`, `embedding_lookup_miss`\n  - `eviction`\n  - `distance_metrics`\n  - `semantic_metrics`\n  - `sparse_vs_dense`\n  - `auto_selection`\n  - `invalidation`\n  - `cleanup_expired`\n  - `eviction_strategies`\n  - `capacity_pressure`\n  - `concurrent`\n- **Configurations**: \n  - `eviction`: `measurement_time(Duration::from_secs(10))`\n  - `cleanup_expired`: `measurement_time(Duration::from_secs(5))`\n  - `eviction_strategies`: `measurement_time(Duration::from_secs(5))`\n  - `concurrent`: `measurement_time(Duration::from_secs(10))`\n\n---\n\n### 11. **tensor_checkpoint**\n\n#### checkpoint_bench\n- **Groups**: `checkpoint_create`, `checkpoint_rollback`, `checkpoint_list`, `checkpoint_metadata`\n- **Configurations**: \n  - `checkpoint_create`: `sample_size(10)`, `measurement_time(Duration::from_secs(5))`\n  - `checkpoint_rollback`: `sample_size(10)`, `measurement_time(Duration::from_secs(5))`\n\n---\n\n### 12. **tensor_unified**\n\n#### tensor_unified_bench\n- **Groups**: (individual benchmarks, no explicit groups)\n  - `create_entity` (sizes: 10, 100, 1000)\n  - `embed_batch` (sizes: 10, 100, 1000)\n  - `find_nodes` (sizes: 10, 100, 1000)\n  - `unified_item` (`new`, `with_data`, `with_score_and_embedding`)\n- **Configurations**: Uses async Tokio runtime\n\n---\n\n### 13. **query_router**\n\n#### query_router_bench\n- **Groups**: `relational_execute`, `graph_execute`, `vector_execute`, `mixed_workload`, `parse_vs_execute`, `throughput`, `cross_engine`, `cross_engine_scale`\n- **Configurations**: \n  - `graph_execute`: `sample_size(10)` for `find_node`\n  - `cross_engine_scale`: `sample_size(50)` (fewer samples for expensive benchmarks)\n\n---\n\n### 14. **neumann_shell**\n\n#### neumann_shell_bench\n- **Groups**: `shell_execute`, `shell_format`, `shell_insert`\n- **Configurations**: Uses `peak_alloc` for memory tracking\n- **Note**: Prints peak RAM usage\n\n---\n\n### 15. **neumann_server**\n\n#### web_bench\n- **Groups**: `template_rendering`, `expandable_components`, `data_operations`\n- **Configurations**: \n  - `data_operations`: `throughput(Throughput::Elements(1))`\n- **Note**: Benchmarks HTML template rendering and data operations\n\n---\n\n### 16. **tensor_spatial**\n\n#### spatial_bench\n- **Groups**: `insert`, `bulk_load`, `region_query`, `nearest_query`, `radius_query`, `remove`, `split_strategies`, `query_strategies`, `nearest_k_sizes`, `nearest_centroid`, `3d`, `mixed_workload`\n- **Configurations**: \n  - `mixed_workload`: `sample_size(10)`\n  - Heavy tests guarded by `BENCH_HEAVY` environment variable\n  - Various benchmarks support different dataset sizes (1K, 10K, 100K, 1M entries)\n\n---\n\n## Summary Statistics\n\n- **Total bench targets**: 16\n- **Crates with benchmarks**: 16\n- **Total benchmark groups**: ~90+ (many crates define multiple groups)\n- **Custom `measurement_time` configs**: 6 groups (cache_bench, checkpoint_bench)\n- **Custom `sample_size` configs**: 8+